{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Sanrio 迷遊韓又多個景點去啦！全韓國首間布甸狗常設主題烘焙咖啡廳「Bakery Cafe Pompompurin」於 7 月 28 日進駐首爾新世界百貨江南店。全店以手作烘焙坊為概念，每日新鮮出爐多款可愛麵包，有布甸狗最經典的「屁屁麵包」外，還有布甸狗造型的，朋友仔造型的麵包，賣相非常可愛，粉絲見到一定非常興奮！</p><p>Bakery Cafe Pompompurin 地址：首爾市瑞草區新盤浦路 176 新世界百貨江南店 B1 Sweet Park 營業時間：星期一至四10:30-20:00，星期五、六、日及公眾假期 10:30-20:30</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178525449926495949_5687631276a68d263ad62c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17852545008998989_14641646886a68d26555f63.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178525450284854409_15602300356a68d2674452c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17852545045776197_1980232056a68d2696eef2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178525450691919417_4204453596a68d26b509c2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178525450843555251_17622438336a68d26d14db3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T16:18:32.514691+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":343,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}